{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonfire Simulator is a realistic campfire simulation game where you can build fires, decorate your surroundings, and enjoy the cozy atmosphere of a night by the flames. Add logs, ignite the fire to increase its intensity, cook food, and set up camping tools. Keep in mind that changing weather conditions can affect the strength of your fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>demo version</strong> lets you experience a portion of the core systems featured in the full game.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable on <strong>one map</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic campfire management</strong> mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chop trees</strong> to gather logs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random events</strong> that change the flow of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooking and camping tools</strong> that rely on your campfire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect embers</strong> to strengthen your fire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock basic abilities</strong> during your session</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Bonfire Simulator Demo is designed to give you an early hands-on look at the essential campfire survival experience before the full release. Light a fire, keep it burning, and immerse yourself in the peaceful warmth of the flames.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3929300?t=1755053459","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3929300?t=1755053459","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929300/a3aeb6625eb66173a3ba749448d4ce0f2928f103/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755053459","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929300/a3aeb6625eb66173a3ba749448d4ce0f2928f103/c